# An archive allows research use of contact data once attribution is recorded.
# One request qualifies, one awaits duty evidence, and one is outside the
# research purpose. The ODRL snapshot checks a compound constraint using
# broader categories from the DPV and Personal Data taxonomies.
# Sources https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-model/
#         https://w3id.org/dpv/2.3/dpv/
#         https://w3id.org/dpv/2.3/pd/

Use ODRL snapshot logic with namespace "https://example.org/research-snapshot#".
Use prefix ex with namespace "https://example.org/research-snapshot#".
Use prefix dpv with namespace "https://w3id.org/dpv#".
Use prefix pd with namespace "https://w3id.org/dpv/pd#".
Use prefix skos with namespace "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#".
Use prefix odrl with namespace "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/".

# Only the taxonomy links this snapshot uses are supplied.

dpv:AcademicResearch has skos:broader dpv:ResearchAndDevelopment.
pd:EmailAddressWork has skos:broader pd:EmailAddress.
pd:EmailAddress has skos:broader pd:Contact.

# Both category constraints must hold, and attribution is a precondition.

evaluation is an evaluation.
evaluation has policy agreement1 and evaluation has conflictStrategy prohibit.
evaluation has request ready and evaluation has request pending and evaluation has request marketing.
agreement1 is an agreement and agreement1 has profile snapshotProfile.
agreement1 has assigner archive and agreement1 has permission researchUse.
researchUse is a permission.
researchUse has assignee researcher and researchUse has action odrl:use and researchUse has target directory.
researchUse has constraint scope and researchUse has duty credit.
scope is a logicalConstraint and scope has andOperands [research, contactData].
research is a constraint and research has leftOperand dpv:hasPurpose.
research has operator withinCategory and research has rightOperand dpv:ResearchAndDevelopment.
contactData is a constraint and contactData has leftOperand dpv:hasPersonalData.
contactData has operator withinCategory and contactData has rightOperand pd:Contact.
credit is a duty and credit has action odrl:attribute.

# The ready and pending requests have the same observations and separate
# duty records. The marketing request records attribution and fails scope.

ready is a request and pending is a request and marketing is a request.
ready has assignee researcher and ready has action odrl:use and ready has target directory.
pending has assignee researcher and pending has action odrl:use and pending has target directory.
marketing has assignee researcher and marketing has action odrl:use and marketing has target directory.
ready has subject visitor and ready has state researchState and ready has fulfilledDuty credit.
pending has subject visitor and pending has state researchState.
marketing has subject visitor and marketing has state marketingState and marketing has fulfilledDuty credit.

researchState is a state and researchState has subject visitor.
ex:researchState has dpv:hasPurpose dpv:AcademicResearch and ex:researchState has dpv:hasPersonalData pd:EmailAddressWork.
marketingState is a state and marketingState has subject visitor.
ex:marketingState has dpv:hasPurpose dpv:Marketing and ex:marketingState has dpv:hasPersonalData pd:EmailAddressWork.
